WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.340
Gather your ingredients before you start,

00:00:03.090 --> 00:00:05.480
flour, sugar, baking powder,

00:00:05.690 --> 00:00:08.560
salt, eggs, milk, oil,

00:00:08.790 --> 00:00:13.300
and vanilla. Check the baking powder's
date and read allergen labels.

00:00:13.870 --> 00:00:14.900
Set out your bowls,

00:00:15.230 --> 00:00:19.620
scales, and cake pan so nothing interrupts
you once mixing begins.

